    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MAHER & COMPANY SCSI RICS  IPAV - This instantly appealing, wonderfully spacious light-filled, 2 bed, 2nd floor apartment with parking enjoys well-proportioned, light-filled accommodation complete with SOUTH-EAST facing balcony. The lounge area enjoys double height, perfect for the creation of a MEZZANINE AREA. The property is tastefully decorated throughout in neutral tones and is exceptionally well-maintained. The perfect STARTER HOME or INVESTMENT opportunity situated within this exceptionally well-maintained development within minutes of the Luas, The Citywest Shopping Centre, Saggart Village, The Citywest Golf & Leisure complex, local eateries to include the Anvil & Avoca, The Naas road/ N7 & M50 are within a short commute. Early viewing is highly advised in order to fully appreciate its size, convenience and quality of finish. REGISTER YOUR INTEREST BY EMAIL."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance own door to hallway with wood flooring, walk in storage press with shelving. Separate hot press.\r\nLounge / Kitchen/ Dining room : 4.57m x 7.10m LARGE VAULTED CEILING IDEAL FOR THE CREATION OF A MEZZANINE wrapped units and presses, tiled splash area, tiled flooring, wood flooring, \r\nBedroom 1 : 4.30m x 2.68m built in wardrobes, wood flooring, French door leads to the balcony\r\nBedroom 2 : 2.61m x 3.22m built in wardrobes, wood flooring, French door leads to the balcony\r\nSpacious bathroom : 2.57m x 2.98m bath with glass shower screen, pedestal w.h.b. - w.c. - tiled splash areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Double-glazed windows throughout\r\nGas central heating (Replaced boiler) \r\nNew pump circa 2021\r\nWired for an alarm system\r\nTrip switch fuse board\r\nModern Kitchen\r\nBoth bedrooms have built-in wardrobes\r\nLift and stairwell\r\nSurface car parking x 2 permits plus visitor / Gated basement parking \r\nService charge circa €2,038.43 Feb 2026 - 31 Jan 2027 €2,106.77 in 2025\r\nCurrent rent €2,225 last reviewed November 2024 \r\nCuala Property management"
      },
      {
